  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de la operacin es contribuir con los esfuerzos hacia la eliminacin de la transmisin autctona de la malaria en RD y evitar la reintroduccin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the operation is to contribute with the efforts towards the elimination of the autochthonous transmission of malaria in the DR and to avoid reintroduction.</narrative>
  </description>
